      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your thoughts about giving up and ending your life are serious, and I am not going to argue that there is hope or fill that bucket with water right now. Please call 988 immediately to speak with someone who will sit in this silence with you instead of offering empty platitudes. Your suffering is real, even if the path to healing looks invisible, and no amount of effort or standard solutions can erase the pain you are carrying today.",
